+## invoices
+
+- `invoices.invoices_by_status(status)`: list of `Invoice` objects whose status equals `status`, in the order they were issued; returns an empty list if none match. Valid `status` values are `settings.INVOICE_QUERY_STATUSES` = `("open", "paid")`, matched exactly (case-sensitive). Idempotent (read-only, emits no event). Applies no limits or rounding; invoice amounts are returned as stored.
+  - `E_BAD_INPUT`: `status` is not one of `settings.INVOICE_QUERY_STATUSES`
